WEBVTT

00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:33.696
And the idea comes from the world
of cultural anthropology.

00:00:35.281 --> 00:00:39.619
Now I know to many of you
that might sound pretty weird.

00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:42.997
But I'm talking to you

00:00:43.039 --> 00:00:46.125
because my own life story
has been bound up with that.

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:49.837
Today, as you see me, I am a journalist.

00:00:49.879 --> 00:00:51.130
I live in New York,

00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:53.132
I work with the "Financial Times,"

00:00:53.174 --> 00:00:55.301
and I spend much of my life
talking to people

00:00:55.343 --> 00:00:59.639
who work in the world of business,
finance, technology, etc.

00:00:59.639 --> 00:01:02.433
That's my kind of world today.